+# Telegram Igor — write and post healthexps.com blogs
+
+**Bot:** `@Igor_theibot` (Railway Igor V2 + Grok)  
+**Site repo:** `yperez-dot/healthexps-www`  
+**Tool:** `publish_blog`
+
+Igor posts blogs **in healthexps-www**, not in this config repo. Do not dump articles into `igor-config`.
+
+## What you say in Telegram
+
+1. **Write it** — paste the piece (or the facts + source). Igor drafts EN (and ES if you want both). He does not pick a plan.
+2. **Post it / put it live** — Igor calls `publish_blog` with `confirmed=true` and `mode=live`. That opens a PR on `healthexps-www` and merges to `main`. Netlify deploys.
+3. **Just open a PR** — say “open a PR” / “don’t merge yet”. `mode=pr`.
+
+## What the tool writes
+
+- `blog/<en-slug>.md` (Eleventy layout `layouts/blog-post.njk`)
+- `es/blog/<es-slug>.md` when Spanish is included
+- Listing cards on `/blog/` (date order) and `/es/blog/` (first)
+- `sitemap.xml` + hreflang
+
+Header, footer, GA4, canonical, scroll-to-top, and TPMO disclaimer come from the layouts. Do not paste placeholder “Content unavailable”.
+
+## Railway secret
+
+`GITHUB_TOKEN` on **Igor V2** and **igor-config** must have **Contents** and **Pull requests** write on `yperez-dot/healthexps-www`. If publish returns 403, refresh that token — do not paste it in Telegram.
+
+After this code lands, **redeploy Igor V2** so Telegram loads `publish_blog`.
